{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":10055,"chapterID":77,"chapterNumber":"4","sectionNumber":"28-425.5","title":"§ 28-425.5 Term of license.","sourceHTMLPath":"code-sections/general-administrative-provisions/chapters/Chapter 4.html","blocks":[{"id":"10055-html-1","kind":"html","html":"</div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160350\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160350\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>The term of an elevator agency technician license and a restricted elevator agency technician license shall be two (2) years.</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160351\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160351\"></AnnotationDrawer><div>(L.L. 2021/126, 11/7/2021, eff. 1/1/2022) \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160352\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160352\"></AnnotationDrawer><div class=\"EdNoteSm\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;\">Editor's note:</span> For related unconsolidated provisions, see Appendix A at <Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '/codes/newyorkcity/latest/NYCadmin/0-0-0-135195', hash: '#JD_L.L.2021/126' }}\">L.L. 2021/126</Link>. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>\n<div><span depth=\"6\"></span><CodeOptions destID=\"rid-0-0-0-160353\" class=\"Article\"></CodeOptions><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-160353\" class=\"Article toc-destination rbox\" style=\"margin-top: .5rem\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-160353\"></AnnotationDrawer><h6><a name=\"JD_28-426\" id=\"JD_28-426\" title=\"28-426\"></a>Article 426: Elevator Agency Helper</h6></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div><div class=\"clearfix\"></div></div>","plainText":"The term of an elevator agency technician license and a restricted elevator agency technician license shall be two (2) years. (L.L. 2021/126, 11/